### 5.1 Data Dictionary & Key Constraints

* **`USERS.trust_score`:** Integer range [0–100], derived dynamically from completed transactions, positive peer reviews, and verified national identification.
* **`LISTINGS.cosmetic_grade`:** Constrained ENUM: `'Like New'`, `'Excellent'`, `'Good'`, `'Fair'`.
* **`DIAGNOSTICS.imei_status`:** Constrained ENUM: `'Clean'`, `'Financed'`, `'Blacklisted'`. A listing is auto-quarantined if `imei_status != 'Clean'`.

