## Module 7: The 32-Point Diagnostic Inspection Standard

To eliminate information asymmetry, devices labeled **Certified Refurbished** or **Inspected** undergo a systematic hardware audit across 5 core functional clusters:

```
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                           32-POINT DIAGNOSTIC AUDIT SYSTEM                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  1. Display & Visuals (Points 1 - 7)                                              |
|     - Digitizer digit registration across all 9 screen zones                      |
|     - Dead / stuck subpixel detection on pure white and pure black canvases       |
|     - Organic LED Burn-in evaluation                                              |
|     - TrueTone / Ambient Light Sensor auto-brightness calibration                 |
|     - Touch latency and 120Hz ProMotion/High-refresh rate continuity              |
|     - Backlight bleeding and optical uniformity                                   |
|     - Glass lamination adhesion (delamination or bubbling checks)                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  2. Biometrics & Sensors (Points 8 - 13)                                          |
|     - 3D Structured Light Facial Matrix (FaceID / IR Projector)                    |
|     - Capacitive or Ultrasonic Fingerprint Sensor accuracy                        |
|     - 3-Axis Gyroscope orientation stability                                      |
|     - Magnetometer (Compass heading precision)                                    |
|     - Barometric pressure seal test (Water resistance integrity indicator)        |
|     - Proximity sensor call cutoff function                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  3. Audio & Acoustic Transducers (Points 14 - 18)                                 |
|     - Earpiece speaker dynamic range at 85 dB                                     |
|     - Bottom-firing loudspeaker acoustic distortion at peak volume                |
|     - Primary beamforming voice microphone clarity                                |
|     - Noise cancellation microphone attenuation performance                       |
|     - Telephoto/Video directional audio recording                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  4. Radio Frequency & Connectivity (Points 19 - 25)                               |
|     - Cellular baseband modem registration (LTE / 5G Sub-6 / mmWave)              |
|     - Dual SIM / eSIM profile read and provisioning                               |
|     - Wi-Fi 6/6E 2.4GHz vs 5GHz antenna throughput                                |
|     - Bluetooth 5.x Low Energy peripheral pairing                                 |
|     - NFC (Near-Field Communication) polling for Apple/Google Pay                 |
|     - GPS / GLONASS / Galileo satellite constellation lock                        |
|     - Ultra-Wideband (UWB) precision spatial finding                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  5. Power, Thermal & Logic (Points 26 - 32)                                       |
|     - Direct Current Fast Charging handshake (USB-PD / PPS)                       |
|     - Qi Wireless induction receiver coil efficiency                              |
|     - Battery coulomb counter integrity and maximum capacity %                    |
|     - Sustained thermal dissipation test under multi-core load                    |
|     - Optical Image Stabilization (OIS) coil actuation on all camera modules      |
|     - Flash memory read/write sequential throughput (NAND degradation test)       |
|     - Carrier lock and international IMEI database blacklist verification         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+

```

